description: |
  The :ref:`/plugins/prepare/ansible` and :ref:`/plugins/prepare/feature`
  prepare plugins now recommend ``/usr/bin/python3`` instead of requiring
  it. tmt still installs it when a package provides it, but no longer
  fails on guests without such package, e.g. RHEL 6, where playbooks may
  set ``ansible_python_interpreter`` to a custom interpreter.
